{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/364caa3870f3c9c4f1db37a770ef5939.avif?t=1766159658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras_big/364caa3870f3c9c4f1db37a770ef5939.avif?t=1766159658 width=800 height=258 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Silkgrove</strong>\u00a0is an open-world game set in a post-apocalyptic environment following a war between humans and machines. In the game, you take on the role of Annie, a young Restorer equipped with a set of tools and a mission to help rebuild the  world using sustainable practices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix things, craft new items, and explore to uncover stories from each place you visit. You can decorate your  home camp, meet interesting characters, and learn about the past world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play at your own pace, traveling through various environments, collecting resources, facing challenges, or simply camping and enjoying serene landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.poster.avif?t=1766159658\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.webm?t=1766159658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.mp4?t=1766159658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong>: Journey through a  post-apocalyptic landscape filled with unique items, resources, and past world secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting and Scavenging</strong>: Gather materials and salvage items from the environment for your needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Build</strong>: Use materials to create tools, scrape for materials, and upgrade your home camp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixing and Maintenance</strong>: Repair broken items and maintain tools to keep everything running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming</strong>: Grow  food, use hydroponics, monitor food forests, and manage resources sustainably to support your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Collect and manage different resources to aid your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Home</strong>: Camp, customize, and upgrade your mobile camp home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Stories</strong>: Find out about the past and meet new characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/bbfb3e060d908c1dfe41b7c8a744ef89.poster.avif?t=1766159658\" width=800 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/bbfb3e060d908c1dfe41b7c8a744ef89.webm?t=1766159658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570350?t=1766159658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570350?t=1766159658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/a91da4dcbcaa9d7adc80f542923cd11080d0b3c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766159658","capsule_imagev5":"https://